# A stub Quickshell singleton, for testing a shell file under Qt's own qml
# runtime instead of under quickshell.
#
# ⛔ WHY NOT JUST RUN quickshell? Because it connects to Wayland at startup, and
# on this desktop that means the LIVE session — `env -u WAYLAND_DISPLAY` does
# not prevent it, it falls back to the running compositor's socket. A test that
# has to be run carefully is a test that stops being run.
#
# What is stubbed is deliberately tiny: the two things I18n.qml touches.
singleton Quickshell 1.0 Quickshell.qml
